ent": "", "author": "UltraPatriotMAGA", "created": 1787314463509, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "UltraPatriotMAGA", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCNPKuBR.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/TdqYmM54ORWI.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/Qn3xCLVqYwzXWQcI.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 521}], "blurhash": "UDJ*M4_2C88^~W-;IpxFK%DiMI-;NeIUaJWU", "full_resolution": [733, 1080]}, "title": "Questioning science is how you do science. Except when it disagrees with me ", "last_comment_created": 1787329072233, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 8, "score_up": 33, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f\u00a0\ufe0f GARBAGE PEOPLE  \ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCNPLSDO", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8791656, "raw_content": "I've been noticing a trend for a minute now that accounts that start with MAGA in their name are not genuine or authentic, and most appear to be reddit infiltrators or glowies here to make us look bad in the comments to promote their agenda that we are racist mysognist. Now we dont have downvotes to fight the manipulation. Has anyone noticed this slow forum slide over the last couple years? Im about to leave soon if there isnt a purge. THE MODS BETTER BE TAKING REPORTING SERIOUSLY.  \r\n\r\nOne of them, MAGAMovementforlife, just called me a Pedophile. Which is typical of leftest today that ive seen debating. Ive given up debating these idiots because their \"go to\" is calling us pedophiles now, on top of this idiotic attack on the Baby Boomer generation. The children of the men who defeated the Nazis... meanwhile its our generation that is allwoing the greatest muslim invasion and communist socialist invasion of all time. Its our generation to blame, and we better stand up if we want to save our future generations from these infiltrators or its going to get far far worse. \r\n\r\nIts time for the mods to step up and purge these idiotic accounts and save our board from these garbage posters ruinng our site with their propaganda sliding us into the trap the left wants so they can point out posts and say \"see, this is what they really believe\" when thats not true at all. We are all suposed to be on the same side, but im seeing attacks here by supposed supporters on other supporters that are just way out of line and akin to be leftest in disguised causing division on our board.  \r\n\r\nThank you for attention to this matter.", "author": "BrainwashedbyTrump", "created": 1787321456591, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "BrainwashedbyTrump", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Accounts with MAGA in their name need to be closely scrutinized and many banned, not authentic or genuine to our board. ", "last_comment_created": 1787327893977, "content": "<p>I've been noticing a trend for a minute now that accounts that start with MAGA in their name are not genuine or authentic, and most appear to be reddit infiltrators or glowies here to make us look bad in the comments to promote their agenda that we are racist mysognist. Now we dont have downvotes to fight the manipulation. Has anyone noticed this slow forum slide over the last couple years? Im about to leave soon if there isnt a purge. THE MODS BETTER BE TAKING REPORTING SERIOUSLY.</p>\n<p>One of them, MAGAMovementforlife, just called me a Pedophile. Which is typical of leftest today that ive seen debating. Ive given up debating these idiots because their &quot;go to&quot; is calling us pedophiles now, on top of this idiotic attack on the Baby Boomer generation. The children of the men who defeated the Nazis... meanwhile its our generation that is allwoing the greatest muslim invasion and communist socialist invasion of all time. Its our generation to blame, and we better stand up if we want to save our future generations from these infiltrators or its going to get far far worse.</p>\n<p>Its time for the mods to step up and purge these idiotic accounts and save our board from these garbage posters ruinng our site with their propaganda sliding us into the trap the left wants so they can point out posts and say &quot;see, this is what they really believe&quot; when thats not true at all. We are all suposed to be on the same side, but im seeing attacks here by supposed supporters on other supporters that are just way out of line and akin to be leftest in disguised causing division on our board.</p>\n<p>Thank you for attention to this matter.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 26, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCNPLBMn", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 26, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "pocrime", "id": 8791589, "raw